Linear elastic solid buckling analysis; units N, mm, MPa.
Material E=70000 MPa, nu=0.33; no self-weight.
Actual STEP geometry is validated before generating a conforming structured quadratic solid mesh.
CalculiX *BUCKLE on the initially unloaded body computes the linear reference-load stress state and solves the elastic buckling problem. The same load is independently solved with *STATIC on the selected mesh to retain reference displacements, reactions, strains and stresses. No preloading is added to the buckling load set.
